<!DOCTYPE html>

<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Log a Trip | MatatuHub</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            margin: 30px;
            background: #f4f6f9;
            color: #222;
        }

    h1, h2 {
        color: #243447;
    }

    .card {
        max-width: 650px;
        background: white;
        padding: 25px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
    }

    label {
        display: block;
        margin-top: 18px;
        font-weight: bold;
    }

    input, textarea {
        width: 100%;
        box-sizing: border-box;
        padding: 10px;
        margin-top: 7px;
        border: 1px solid #ccc;
        border-radius: 5px;
        font: inherit;
    }

    textarea {
        min-height: 120px;
        resize: vertical;
    }

    .button {
        display: inline-block;
        padding: 11px 16px;
        background: #1769aa;
        color: white;
        border: none;
        border-radius: 5px;
        cursor: pointer;
        text-decoration: none;
        margin-top: 20px;
        font: inherit;
    }

    .secondary {
        background: #6c757d;
        margin-left: 8px;
    }

    .message {
        padding: 12px;
        margin-bottom: 15px;
        background: #e8f4fd;
        border-radius: 5px;
    }

    .info {
        background: #f1f3f5;
        padding: 12px;
        border-radius: 5px;
        margin-top: 15px;
    }
</style>
```

</head>
<body>

```
<h1>Log a Trip</h1>
<p>Record a trip using your current vehicle assignment.</p>

{% with messages = get_flashed_messages() %}
    {% if messages %}
        {% for message in messages %}
            <div class="message">{{ message }}</div>
        {% endfor %}
    {% endif %}
{% endwith %}

<section class="card">
    <h2>Assignment Details</h2>

    <div class="info">
        <p><strong>Vehicle:</strong>
            {{ vehicle.reg_no if vehicle else "Not available" }}
        </p>

        <p><strong>Route:</strong>
            {{ route.name if route else "Not available" }}
        </p>

        <p><strong>From:</strong>
            {{ route.start_point if route else "Not available" }}
        </p>

        <p><strong>To:</strong>
            {{ route.destination if route else "Not available" }}
        </p>
    </div>

    <form method="POST" action="{{ url_for('driver.new_trip_log') }}">
        <label for="notes">Trip Notes (optional)</label>
        <textarea
            id="notes"
            name="notes"
            maxlength="2000"
            placeholder="Enter any relevant trip information..."
        ></textarea>

        <button class="button" type="submit">Save Trip Log</button>

        <a class="button secondary"
           href="{{ url_for('driver.my_assignment') }}">
            Cancel
        </a>
    </form>
</section>
```

</body>
</html>
